1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:03,680
(Amy:)and a place to stay in Riyadh
for the winter.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:06,880
(Sheldon:)Well, that explains those
puzzling camel race photos

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,250
(Sheldon:)on your Facebook page.

4
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,780
And consider this:

5
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:13,420
(Amy:)without you to make the case
for the physics department,

6
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,020
(Amy:)the task will fall to people
like Leonard and Rajesh.

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,220
(Sheldon:)Are you trying to scare me?

8
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:20,490
'Cause you're succeeding.

9
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:22,230
(Amy:)Well, then prepare
to be terrified.

10
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,860
(Amy:)If your friends
are unconvincing,

11
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,870
(Amy:)this year's donations
might go to,

12
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,330
(Amy:)say, the geology department.

13
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:30,000
Oh, dear, no! Not the dirt people!

14
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,740
(Amy:)Or worse-- it could go to...

15
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,780
(Amy:)the liberal arts.

16
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:40,540
(Sheldon:)No!

17
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:43,610
(Amy:)Millions of dollars
being showered on poets,

18
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:47,290
(Amy:)literary theorists
and students of gender studies.

19
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:51,320
(Sheldon:)Oh, the humanities!

20
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,090
(Leonard:)On the bright side, I don't
think President Siebert

21
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:58,300
(Leonard:)will be making us go
to any more fund-raisers.

22
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,230
(Howard:)It was so much easier
at my bar mitzvah.

